{"pin":"BH00554","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00554","anchor":"","first_line":"O Haydar-'Alí! Say: O peoples of the earth! Purge your ears for this blessed Word from whatsoever [3.5s]... ...O my God, the God of bounty and mercy! Thou art that King by Whose commanding word the whole creation","first_line_orig":"یا حیدر قبل علی بگو یا اهل ارض آذان را از برای اینکلمه مبارکه از آنچه  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"1350","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#497\"\u003eLL#497\u003c/a\u003e","full_text_parts":["O my God, the God of bounty and mercy! Thou art that King by Whose commanding word the whole creation hath been called into being; and Thou art that All-Bountiful One the doings of Whose servants have never hindered Him from showing forth His grace, nor have they frustrated the revelations of His bounty.\nSuffer this servant, I beseech Thee, to attain unto that which is the cause of his salvation in every world of Thy worlds.  Thou art, verily, the Almighty, the Most Powerful, the All-Knowing, the All-Wise."],"translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15690.234","source":"BLIB_Or15690","locator":"234"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15699.080","source":"BLIB_Or15699","locator":"080"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15718.155","source":"BLIB_Or15718","locator":"155"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:084a","source":"INBA30","locator":"084a","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=46"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA42:001","source":"INBA42","locator":"001","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v042/?page=3"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:029x","source":"INBA65","locator":"029x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=31"},{"kind":"music","code":"A. Youssefi","source":"A","locator":"Youssefi","url":"https://music.aliyoussefi.com/track/called-into-being"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.044x","source":"ADH1","locator":"044x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.319x","source":"AHM","locator":"319x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-319.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.141x","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"141x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-143.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#684","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"684","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/453841202"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMJA.034x","source":"MMJA","locator":"034x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PMP#159x","source":"PMP","locator":"159x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/586539084"},{"kind":"publication","code":"VAA.202-202x","source":"VAA","locator":"202-202x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/vaa.pdf#page=222"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.168","source":"BPRY","locator":"168","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/942775209"},{"kind":"translation","code":"PM#159x","source":"PM","locator":"159x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/440542459"}]},{"code":"BH00554KIN","anchor":"kin","translations":[{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"lv","lang_name":"Latvian"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"id","lang_name":"Indonesian"},{"language":"no","lang_name":"Norwegian"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"},{"language":"bi","lang_name":"Bislama"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"zh-Hans","lang_name":"Simplified Chinese"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"tl","lang_name":"T